      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.24 (vs ₹1.93 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.24 (down from ₹1.93 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.32b (up 12% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹124.2m (down 36% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.4% (down from 9.3% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 14% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 14% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
